  "title": "Zesty Sour Kenyan Saskatoon Berry Stew",
  "description": "A sour and comforting Kenyan stew featuring Saskatoon berries, perfect for a sick day, with a pillowy texture and ayurvedic-sattvic friendly ingredients. This dish is easy to make and delicious to eat.",
